  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Ember-Touched)</em> at level 17; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“If you die, you will be furious about it.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Phoenix Oath (1/Long Rest).</strong> When you would drop to 0 hit points, you instead drop to 1 hit point and erupt in a controlled blaze. Each hostile creature within 10 feet takes fire damage equal to 2d6 + your proficiency bonus, and you immediately end one condition affecting you (charmed, frightened, or restrained).</p>",
